Class Figure

01.Constructor
First the class Figure which is a parent class is created.
Then the constructor runs automatically when we create a new figure. X and y are the starting coordinates.
We store the x and y value inside the object.

02.Move method
This is a method that moves the figure.
We add the dx value and dy value to the current x and y positions

03.reset position method
Method that puts the figure back at position (0, 0); We set the x and y coordinates to 0.

04.to string method
Here we return a string showing the figures data.

05.area method
This is a method to calculate the area but because figure doesn’t know how to calculate its area we throw an error if someone tries to use it.

06.perimeter method
This is a method to calculate the perimeter but because figure doesn’t know how to calculate its area we throw an error if someone tries to use it.

Class ColoredSquare

